{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02649",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.34,
      "end_seconds": 5.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Mm good evening doctor thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.55,
      "end_seconds": 12.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.67,
      "end_seconds": 28.76,
      "duration_seconds": 15.09,
      "text": "I'm, I'm here because of stiff aching shoulders and hips. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.51,
      "end_seconds": 32.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.49,
      "end_seconds": 52.53,
      "duration_seconds": 18.04,
      "text": "well, I'm on iron tablets, once a day. Naproxen i take it 250 milligrams, twice a day for the knee pain i'd been on diclofenac, not any more though, I stopped"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.12,
      "end_seconds": 54.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "when did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.09,
      "end_seconds": 60.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "it's been about four days, I'm fairly sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.02,
      "end_seconds": 66.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.51,
      "end_seconds": 81.71,
      "duration_seconds": 14.2,
      "text": "honestly a couple of times a week. Pretty severe if I'm being honest. It's worse with mornings. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.51,
      "end_seconds": 84.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.57,
      "end_seconds": 99.35,
      "duration_seconds": 13.78,
      "text": "sorry what was I saying it usually comes with difficulty getting out of bed the difficulty getting out of bed? That's been for two months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.02,
      "end_seconds": 103.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "right any a mild temperature as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.68,
      "end_seconds": 115.94,
      "duration_seconds": 10.26,
      "text": "yes, about the same, three days. About mild temperature, a three out of ten, I suppose. It's all the time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.99,
      "end_seconds": 120.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "have you been feeling tired and low?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.97,
      "end_seconds": 128.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "Yeah. Two months, I'd say. With feeling tired and low, moderate, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.73,
      "end_seconds": 137.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Have you had stiff aching shoulders and hips before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.53,
      "end_seconds": 144.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "I had a similar thing a couple of years ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.16,
      "end_seconds": 153.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Did you get headache or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.15,
      "end_seconds": 157.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "none of those, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.49,
      "end_seconds": 165.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "have you had any visual changes or jaw pain on chewing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.14,
      "end_seconds": 173.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Ah no visual changes or jaw pain on chewing none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.06,
      "end_seconds": 177.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.39,
      "end_seconds": 180.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "nothing unusual, you know, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.6,
      "end_seconds": 184.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.78,
      "end_seconds": 189.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.65,
      "end_seconds": 192.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.56,
      "end_seconds": 197.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.1,
      "end_seconds": 201.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.1,
      "end_seconds": 205.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.97,
      "end_seconds": 221.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.71,
      "end_seconds": 227.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "my mother had a stroke. My uncle has high cholesterol"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.29,
      "end_seconds": 234.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.13,
      "end_seconds": 247.74,
      "duration_seconds": 12.61,
      "text": "I have low haemoglobin for two years. I'm not great at remembering details so bear with me. Arthritis in my knees for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.76,
      "end_seconds": 262.65,
      "duration_seconds": 12.89,
      "text": "Okay yes low haemoglobin and arthritis in your knees are known to us good to have that clear. Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.15,
      "end_seconds": 275.36,
      "duration_seconds": 12.21,
      "text": "okay, so I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago i don't remember which one, or what happened exactly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.6,
      "end_seconds": 289.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.51,
      "end_seconds": 305.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Alright bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.53,
      "end_seconds": 331.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.35,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 98 percent on room air heart rate 67 temperature 36.6. And BP is 119 over 81."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.39,
      "end_seconds": 338.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "alright over here please and I'll take a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.29,
      "end_seconds": 342.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.1,
      "end_seconds": 361.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "The shoulders are painful to move but strength is normal and and there is no joint swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.14,
      "end_seconds": 366.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.17,
      "end_seconds": 386.27,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "okay, thinking it through, my working impression is polymyalgia rheumatica. We shouldn't forget rheumatoid arthritis. Let's get blood tests, for proximal stiffness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 386.85,
      "end_seconds": 390.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I can book that for Thursday at 10 am"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.87,
      "end_seconds": 400.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.95,
      "text": "let's use prednisolone, 15 milligrams, once a day, reducing course you take it by mouth that should help with polymyalgia rheumatica"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.98,
      "end_seconds": 406.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "can I collect it from my own pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.16,
      "end_seconds": 413.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "report any headache or jaw pain immediately see me again in two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 414.71,
      "end_seconds": 416.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "that's fine with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.35,
      "end_seconds": 423.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.27,
      "end_seconds": 431.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "right, I'll do that thank you, doctor"
    }
  ]
